OL,3,AKey takeaways from BBC interview as
OL,4,AEarl Spencer defends claims about King
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong claims made in Swan Song about
OL,7,Fthe King, who was then the Prince of
OL,8,FWales, was that he said "we'll forget
OL,9,Fher soon enough" during an argument
OL,10,Fover whether Princes William and Harry
OL,11,Fshould walk in Diana's funeral
OL,12,Fprocession.
OL,14,FIn a strongly worded response,
OL,15,FBuckingham Palace said the King was
OL,16,F"mindful that the pain of fraternal
OL,17,Fgrief can cloud reason, affect
OL,18,Fjudgement and colour memory in ways
OL,19,Fothers do not recognise, even many
OL,20,Fyears after such a loss".
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
